{
  "id": 8835559260359,
  "title": "Custom Trucking Semi Truck Breaking Through Stone Wall Comforter design 1",
  "handle": "custom-trucking-semi-truck-breaking-through-stone-wall-comforter-7a6b616ec4-7a6b616ec4",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with this custom trucker comforter set from Jeminise, designed especially for semi-truck enthusiasts and road legends. Featuring a bold digital illustration of a semi-truck breaking through a stone wall, this modern bedding set brings a dynamic and stylish energy to any room decor.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Add your own custom text with one text input field to make it truly unique.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester microfiber fabric that is soft, breathable, lightweight, and eco-friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Colors:</strong> Advanced digital printing methods ensure colors remain vibrant and resist fading without harmful chemicals or dyes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes 1 comforter or duvet cover with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheet.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, quick-drying, and recommended to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Cool Red Truck</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
